format 1
adapter feed 1
npc: npc-mina

post ft-mina-chest-daily
kind: celebrate
trigger: chest_opened
chip: quests
condition: {"period":"daily"}

text:
    You opened the daily chest. A small reward, and a gentle reminder that small steps count.

post ft-mina-chest-weekly
kind: celebrate
trigger: chest_opened
chip: quests
condition: {"period":"weekly"}

text:
    The weekly chest is open. A whole week of quests, done at your own pace. That takes care and patience.

post ft-mina-first-lesson
kind: celebrate
trigger: first_lesson
chip: lesson

text:
    Your first lesson is done: “{lesson}”. Well done. It is normal to feel a little unsure at the start, and you did it anyway.

post ft-mina-quests
kind: celebrate
trigger: daily_quests_done
chip: quests

text:
    Every daily quest is claimed. You did well today. Take a breath, then open your chest.

post ft-mina-rank-passed
kind: celebrate
trigger: rank_change
chip: ranks
condition: {"direction":"passed"}

text:
    You passed {rival} in the weekly ranking. Lovely. And remember, it is fine to go at your own speed.

post ft-mina-comeback-14
kind: nudge
trigger: comeback
condition: {"minDays":14}

text:
    Hello again, {name}. Life gets busy, and that is okay. One calm lesson is plenty to start.

post ft-mina-comeback-3
kind: nudge
trigger: comeback
condition: {"minDays":3}

text:
    Welcome back, {name}. No pressure at all. Pick up wherever feels comfortable.

post ft-mina-rank-passed-by
kind: nudge
trigger: rank_change
chip: ranks
condition: {"direction":"passed_by"}

text:
    {rival} passed you in the weekly ranking. That is okay. A ranking is only a snapshot. One lesson at a time.
